{
  "$description": "TwinX legacy (Stellantis Promotool) design tokens. Values are measured from the legacy CSS (css/*.css), which hard-codes them; these tokens name them so new work uses the same values. Edit this file, then run scripts/build.py to regenerate tokens.css and the catalogue.",
